{"id":"d154fdd64209bf0e","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-intrinsic-fixed-point.md","title":"内在固定点","display":"df-intrinsic-fixed-point — 内在固定点","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-intrinsic-fixed-point","aliases":["91-df-intrinsic-fixed-point","91-df-intrinsic-fp","91-df-self-supporting"],"display":"df-intrinsic-fixed-point — 内在固定点","depends_on":["[[91-df-jump-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-intrinsic-fixed-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-intrinsic-fixed-point</span><span>91-df-intrinsic-fp</span><span>91-df-self-supporting</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-intrinsic-fixed-point — 内在固定点"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-intrinsic-fixed-point-—-内在固定点-$\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{int}}$\">df-intrinsic-fixed-point — 内在固定点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{int}}\">\\(\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{int}}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\">\\(J:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\)</span> (强 Kleene 跳跃算子)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (句子否定的编码函数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ConInfo}\">\\(\\operatorname{ConInfo}\\)</span> (信息一致性谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)\n\\coloneqq\n\\{\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\mid\nJ(\\Gamma)=\\Gamma\\land\\operatorname{ConInfo}(\\Gamma)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)\n\\coloneqq\n\\{\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\mid\nJ(\\Gamma)=\\Gamma\\land\\operatorname{ConInfo}(\\Gamma)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}(\\Gamma,\\Delta)\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\exists a\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl((a\\in\\Gamma\\land\\operatorname{neg}(a)\\in\\Delta)\n\\lor(\\operatorname{neg}(a)\\in\\Gamma\\land a\\in\\Delta)\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Comp}(\\Gamma,\\Delta)\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\exists a\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl((a\\in\\Gamma\\land\\operatorname{neg}(a)\\in\\Delta)\n\\lor(\\operatorname{neg}(a)\\in\\Gamma\\land a\\in\\Delta)\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}intrinsic\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Int}_J\n\\coloneqq\n\\{\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)\\mid\n\\forall\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)\\,\n\\operatorname{Comp}(\\Gamma,\\Delta)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}intrinsic\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Int}_J\n\\coloneqq\n\\{\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)\\mid\n\\forall\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)\\,\n\\operatorname{Comp}(\\Gamma,\\Delta)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Int}\">\\(\\mathrm{Int}\\)</span>：与每个固定点都相容的固定点类</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}\">\\(\\operatorname{Comp}\\)</span>：两个固定点不对任何句子作冲突的真/假指派</li>\n</ul>\n<p>内在固定点的定义：\n内在固定点的技术定义是与所有固定点相容，而不是“从最小固定点继续迭代可达”。后者会塌缩回最小固定点，因为最小固定点已经满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(\\Gamma_{\\min})=\\Gamma_{\\min}\">\\(J(\\Gamma_{\\min})=\\Gamma_{\\min}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>内在 vs 外在固定点：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>最小</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup_\\alpha J^\\alpha(\\emptyset)\">\\(\\bigcup_\\alpha J^\\alpha(\\emptyset)\\)</span></td>\n<td>最谨慎</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内在</td>\n<td>与每个固定点相容</td>\n<td>不作与其他固定点冲突的任意二值选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外在</td>\n<td>非内在固定点</td>\n<td>与至少一个固定点冲突</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大内在</td>\n<td>内在固定点类中的最大成员</td>\n<td>不等于任意“最大固定点”</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>内在固定点必与最小固定点相容；更强的要求是它还须与所有其他固定点相容。</p>\n<p>内在固定点的例子：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varphi = T(\\ulcorner T(\\ulcorner 0=0 \\urcorner) \\urcorner)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varphi = T(\\ulcorner T(\\ulcorner 0=0 \\urcorner) \\urcorner)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这类有根句已在最小固定点得到支持，因而不会制造固定点间的冲突；但这只是例子，不是内在性的定义。</p>\n<p>外在句子的例子：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau = T(\\ulcorner \\tau \\urcorner) \\text{（真理陈述者）}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau = T(\\ulcorner \\tau \\urcorner) \\text{（真理陈述者）}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau \\notin \\Gamma_{\\mathrm{min}}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau \\notin \\Gamma_{\\mathrm{min}}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau \\text{ 是否真值依赖外在假设}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau \\text{ 是否真值依赖外在假设}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>内在固定点的哲学意义：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>意义</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>自然真理</td>\n<td>不依赖人为假设</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最小扩张</td>\n<td>尽可能接近最小固定点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自洽性</td>\n<td>内部支撑保证自洽</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>内在固定点的选择：\n最大内在固定点可被看作在不与任何固定点冲突的条件下尽量扩张真值指派；该解释依赖上述相容性定义。</p>\n<p>定义的意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>理解内在固定点的定义</li>\n<li>区分内在与外在固定点</li>\n<li>分析固定点选择的自然性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-intrinsic-fixed-point-—-内在固定点-$\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{int}}$","text":"df-intrinsic-fixed-point — 内在固定点 $\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{int}}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-jump-operator]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{int}}","display":false},{"tex":"J:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ConInfo}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)\n\\coloneqq\n\\{\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\mid\nJ(\\Gamma)=\\Gamma\\land\\operatorname{ConInfo}(\\Gamma)\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Comp}(\\Gamma,\\Delta)\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\exists a\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl((a\\in\\Gamma\\land\\operatorname{neg}(a)\\in\\Delta)\n\\lor(\\operatorname{neg}(a)\\in\\Gamma\\land a\\in\\Delta)\\bigr),","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}intrinsic\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Int}_J\n\\coloneqq\n\\{\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)\\mid\n\\forall\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)\\,\n\\operatorname{Comp}(\\Gamma,\\Delta)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Int}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Comp}","display":false},{"tex":"J(\\Gamma_{\\min})=\\Gamma_{\\min}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigcup_\\alpha J^\\alpha(\\emptyset)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi = T(\\ulcorner T(\\ulcorner 0=0 \\urcorner) \\urcorner)","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau = T(\\ulcorner \\tau \\urcorner) \\text{（真理陈述者）}","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau \\notin \\Gamma_{\\mathrm{min}}","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau \\text{ 是否真值依赖外在假设}","display":true}],"bytes":3033,"backlinks":[{"id":"5a2d46f83be2796a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Comp}$ (固定点相容关系, see [[91-df-intrinsic-fixed-point]])"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-51","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df-global-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-global-reflection.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-language.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-model.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchical-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories.md]]\n[[91-df-implication-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-induction-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-inner-outer-logic-difference.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-induction.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-intrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-iterative-construction.md]]\n[[91-df-jump-operator.md]]\n[[91-df-language-with-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-liar-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df-local-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-local-reflection.md]]\n[[91-df-maximal-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-model-theory-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-monotonicity.md]]\n[[91-df-numeral.md]]\n[[91-df-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-ordinal-analysis.md]]\n[[91-df-partial-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-positive-formula.md]]\n[[91-df-predicate-expression.md]]\n[[91-df-predicative-impredicative.md]]\n[[91-df-proof-theory-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-provable-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-quantifier-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-reflection-principle.md]]\n[[91-df-release-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-revision-theory.md]]\n[[91-df-self-reference.md]]\n[[91-df-soundness-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-stable-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df-strengthened-liar.md]]\n[[91-df-strong-kleene.md]]\n[[91-df-strong-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-structure.md]]\n[[91-df-substitution-function.md]]\n[[91-df-superfalsehood.md]]\n[[91-df-supertruth.md]]\n[[91-df-supervaluation.md]]\n[[91-df-three-valued-satisfaction.md]]\n[[91-df-transparency.md]]\n[[91-df-truth-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-truth-biconditional.md]]\n[[91-df-truth-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-truth-definability.md]]\n[[91-df-truth-expansion.md]]\n[[91-df-truth-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-truth-induction.md]]\n[[91-df-truth-iteration.md]]\n[[91-df-truth-model-general.md]]\n[[91-df-truth-negation-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-truth-predicate-typed.md]]\n[[91-df-truth-predicate-varieties.md]]\n[